  "details": "This issue affects Live, and Beta versions of VRChat.\n\nMy VRChat Plus subscription was set to expire a few days from now. I thought that I would test the gifting feature that lets another user gift you, if you already had VRChat Plus.\n\nUnfortunately, my gift does not fully extend the subscription. The gift doesn't extend it to the desired date of 8/28/2024; it only sets it to the exact date a year out that it was gifted (for yearly). I cut my days a bit short, so this is an issue for people who want to gift people to pre-existing subscriptions.",
